uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o4tk071mV_MQ7kNvwEeVMBI&_nc_oc=AdrM91R0z8XnRcjVgjmHI9taAkHmVQfZYsD9Un0h2JFeMtgZG-HruVLToaUoMijixbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyquYYwAgGIVtG09i-2cCbzxxC8bcDJY3OI2ZBR0aetZg&oe=69CA8C24"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AdwYxvs3KlMQ7kNvwH_KcXw&_nc_oc=AdqnR8CT9ox44bi6F1sn589Dgm97NtympFzpx_8IyG9Mz_PDgzufrLf7yoVrPYBlNvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzl0l3TfEsU1CWe4yPwImhuSU3wYkopALEQxCL9RkYHNQ&oe=69CA6FAC"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a3VMkws23MAQ7kNvwEFNPOr&_nc_oc=AdpDHJlvJaHgBiCCadzXQclzHeQhZX6SMGGDI4bmLpnVAQrikhijHJcNQkYWhFiMHHc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyAIvqLby0ajdvZgIX0C94z7SGfPzvXryicbdebnyYnhA&oe=69CA6E9C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EPE38OPLmv8Q7kNvwHvKf36&_nc_oc=Adqium_kPEsLabuKtGM7blVpcxY1ED4ZxpZggOB9EtyrYRvOhXuU7nzPztOh3RzdzCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxFDD1ECKOuOUcyYAmun9SBOvpurV0kLmXaR3SnTT0ARg&oe=69CA621D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sGzCvXJMayoQ7kNvwEzvcxW&_nc_oc=AdoruBXz7pwmptL1KFmROz42IC7s9boCKwa9CHcqJBoeaWexFgXvcQ0CcOdtB6XzhsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxaXmDhMwOa7gVP6cp7fNnWOdxdiP4T4Bvw-8Q088fuyA&oe=69CA674F"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "devel