iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1322084112192171_5775743008516110172_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7ZfLhueshEQ7kNvwG_uo8F&_nc_oc=Adpipd0wMea2VsI-yfj1snkYCxepV5qqbCjZVsYRiDnCywEIX2FrcBPlMU-vXzbW4F0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw-WspVhoGkH8KSMx23d8ZoQNQU4RvJ0GgMEjbVHGesBw&oe=69CA7B18"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Roguelike", "Action", "Shooter", "Scifi", "FPS"], "long_description": "Plasmaborne is an intense VR action roguelike inspired by classics like DOOM and modern hits like Hades. Step into the role of a tech-warrior, battling through the forsaken lands where every encounter tests your reflexes, tactics, and grit. As you fight, strange patterns emerge\u2014hints of a deeper force behind the conflict, waiting to be uncovered by those who persevere.\nCarve your path through handcrafted battlefields packed with relentless enemies and ferocious action. Wield a brutal mix of futuristic guns, demonic melee weapons, and devastating magic. Between fights, upgrade your arsenal and unlock new abilities to forge your perfect build.\nDesigned for pure, fast-paced fun with deep replayability, Plasmaborne brings boomer-shooter intensity into VR with style and substance.\n Key Features:\n\u2022\tClassic shooter gameplay meets roguelike progression\n\u2022\tHandcrafted battlefields with varied layouts\n\u2022\tCombine guns, melee weapons, and magic for creative combat\n\u2022\tDeep upgrade system with evolving builds each run\n\u2022\tPolished, high-octane action with a focus on fun\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast-paced VR action roguelike blending brutal shooter action, handcrafted battlefields, high-tech weapons, and demonic magic. Fight, upgrade, and repeat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cybersnake-X", "support_website_url": "https://cyb